sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Customer
  participant W as Website
  participant S as Support
  C->>W: Opens help page
  W-->>C: Shows articles
  alt Article solves it
    C->>W: Thanks
  else Still stuck
    C->>S: Opens a ticket
    activate S
    S-->>C: Reply within 9 h
    deactivate S
  end
  Note over C,S: Goal: under 4 h by Q1
